Cc: Simon McVittie <simon.mcvittie@collabora.co.uk>
Reviewed-by: Tom Gundersen <teg@jklm.no>
Signed-off-by: David Herrmann <dh.herrmann@gmail.com>
Signed-off-by: David S. Miller <davem@davemloft.net>

(cherry picked from commit 28b5ba2aa0f55d80adb2624564ed2b170c19519e)

Backport to 4.9: sd-bus and varlink call getpeergroups() on every
connection; without the option they log the error and fall back to the
primary group only. The define carries the mainline values (59, parisc
0x4034, sparc 0x003d); it is placed like SO_BINDTOIFINDEX in the previous
patch (after SO_COOKIE in the per-architecture headers, next to
SO_BINDTOIFINDEX in asm-generic) for the same reason. The
group_info->gid[] array layout this reads already exists in 4.9.
